        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cascade%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Cascade once hosted three grand hotels, including the Cascade Canyon House and Hotel Ramona, which catered to tourists until the 1920s.",
